      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this is related.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/too-much-framerateonly-vr\n\nI'm emulating my Quest2 as Vive with ALVR( https://github.com/alvr-org/ALVR ), and I can see 125+ fps on empty world with empty avatar.\n\nIt's just a guess, It may actually be putting unnecessary load on the GPU. Isn't something like thermal throttling occurring in worlds with extremely low CPU usage?",
