  "details": "Oke, this is weird. I was played yesterday in We're On Observation Duty, and it was fine.\n\nToday joined again same world, and i got like 4 fps? What is going on here?\n\nAnd i was not only one. My friend got also weird 5-fps problem in other world. That is Doll House, but i know i played it earlier and it was fine.\n\nThis is getting weirder. Many worlds are fine, but some not. The world where i got low fps for no reason was not even heavy, it's light one. Maybe there might more players who have for no reason weird 5-8 fps. If you have it too, vote it!\n\nI thought VRChat might broken. So i restart it again, and joined same world. Even alone. And low fps problem happens again! Just why?\n\nHopefully more people can make report about weird low fps, even re-join or restart, it's not back to normal. Most worlds have no problems at all. See screenshot pointed out GPU part is extremely high, but CPU is just very low.",
